<resources>
    <!--
      Brand terms: the strings in this block name the party that holds users' funds ("mint" by default) or the notes
      it issues ("note"). A brand that uses other words overrides exactly these, per language, in
      brand/res/values*/strings.xml. All other strings are written without either word (developer options
      aside). See docs/WHITE_LABEL.md.
