    <plurals name="home_unknown_body_hidden">
        <item quantity="one">It isn\'t in your balance for now. Your wallet keeps the note and asks the mint again by itself; once the mint knows it again, it\'s back.</item>
        <item quantity="other">They aren\'t in your balance for now. Your wallet keeps the notes and asks the mint again by itself; once the mint knows them again, they\'re back.</item>
    </plurals>
    <!-- Under the card's text: the user has nothing to do, and who to turn to. -->
    <string name="home_unknown_help">There\'s nothing you need to do. If it stays this way, ask the mint\'s operator.</string>
